meta {
  name: Create Radiology Panel
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/master-data/{{masterDataId}}/radiology-panels
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{businessAccessToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "panelName": "CT Chest + Abdomen Combo",
    "panelCode": "RPNL-CTCA-01",
    "bannerImage": "https://files.example.com/panels/ct-combo.png",
    "categoryId": "fd0c238e-9724-4084-83f8-f83b32e60096",
    "departmentId": "b94e2bc2-37e7-41b8-8ad3-5725b99f02c9",
    "applicableGender": "ALL",
    "applicableAgeGroup": "ADULT",
    "reportType": "COMBINED",
    "turnaroundPriority": "ROUTINE",
    "isActive": true,
    "priceMsrp": 9000,
    "priceMaximum": 8500,
    "priceMinimum": 6000,
    "priceOriginal": 8800,
    "franchisePrice": 7000,
    "commissionPrice": 500,
    "tatMinValue": 2,
    "tatMinUnit": "HOURS",
    "tatMaxValue": 24,
    "tatMaxUnit": "HOURS",
    "panelInstructions": "Fast for 4 hours before the contrast study",
    "isDisableDiscount": false,
    "isBillOnlyTest": false,
    "isEnableCms": true,
    "isPreference": true,
    "isShowOnlineBooking": true,
    "tests": [
      {
        "radiologyTestId": "{{radiologyTestId}}",
        "sortOrder": 1,
        "isRemovable": true,
        "discountPercent": 10
      }
    ]
  }
}

vars:pre-request {
  masterDataId: 2db13b5e-4a25-412f-bcd9-68bcbeea9d59
}

script:post-response {
  const data = res.getBody() && res.getBody().data;
  if (data && data.id) bru.setEnvVar("radiologyPanelId", data.id);
}

tests {
  test("201 Created", function () {
    expect(res.getStatus()).to.equal(201);
  });
}

docs {
  🔒 **RBAC:** requires `business_admin:master_data__add_lab_panel` — enforced by
  `PermissionGuard` (`@RequirePermission`). A caller whose effective permissions
  (user override ?? branch-role override ?? role baseline) lack this get **403
  `PERMISSION_DENIED`**; the `business_admin` / `administrator` roles bypass all
  checks, so `{{businessAccessToken}}` (an admin) still succeeds here. (The
  radiology-panel module reuses the master-data lab-panel permission keys — there
  are no radiology-specific ones.)

  Create a radiology panel inside a master data (`tenantId`/`branchId` from the JWT
  + the path's master data). Captures `radiologyPanelId`. A radiology panel is a
  bundle of radiology **tests** in the same master data: unlike a lab panel it has
  **no result parameters** (the flat radiology model has none), only member tests.
  The whole panel + its `tests[]` are created in one transaction.

  ## Field groups (form section → payload)

  - **Identity:** `panelName` (2–255, **required**), `panelCode` (1–50,
    **required**, unique per master data among active rows), `bannerImage` (≤1024
    URL/path).
  - **Classification (logical refs):** `categoryId`, `departmentId` — optional
    UUIDs validated as UUIDs; replace the placeholders with real ids from
    `GET /categories` · `/departments`.
  - **Applicability + reporting:** `applicableGender` (enum), `applicableAgeGroup`
    (enum), `reportType` (enum), `turnaroundPriority` (enum).
  - **Status:** `isActive`.
  - **Pricing (integer minor units, ≥0):** `priceMsrp`, `priceMinimum`,
    `priceMaximum`, `priceOriginal`, `franchisePrice`, `commissionPrice`.
  - **TAT:** `tatMinValue`/`tatMinUnit`, `tatMaxValue`/`tatMaxUnit`.
  - **Instructions:** `panelInstructions`.
  - **Flags:** `isDisableDiscount`, `isBillOnlyTest`, `isEnableCms`, `isPreference`,
    `isShowOnlineBooking`.
  - **Member tests:** `tests[]` — each `{ radiologyTestId (required UUID),
    sortOrder?, isRemovable?, discountPercent? (0–100) }`. `radiologyTestId` must
    reference an active RadiologyTest in the **same** master data; `discountPercent`
    is additionally checked against that test's own `discountCapPct`.

  ## Enums (UPPERCASE)

  `applicableGender` (ALL|MALE|FEMALE), `applicableAgeGroup`
  (ALL|ADULT|PEDIATRIC|SENIOR), `reportType` (COMBINED|SEPARATE),
  `turnaroundPriority` (ROUTINE|URGENT|STAT), `tat*Unit` (MINUTES|HOURS|DAYS).

  ## Conflicts & cross-field rules

  - `panelName` / `panelCode` unique **per master data** among active rows → 409
    `RADIOLOGY_PANEL_NAME_CONFLICT` / `RADIOLOGY_PANEL_CODE_CONFLICT`.
  - A bad member-test id → 404 `RADIOLOGY_PANEL_TEST_NOT_FOUND`.
  - 404 `MASTER_DATA_NOT_FOUND` if the parent master data is missing/other tenant.

  > No list price is sent here — list pricing is set when the panel is imported
  > into a branch Radiology Panel List.
}
